Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 11:15:19 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 16/52] appmgr: give apps the URI they were launched with

- --launch-uri sets the URI sceAppMgrGetAppParam gives the app, as if
  another app had launched it with it. Without it the app gets an empty
  string, like after a LiveArea launch.
- Like a Vita, only the first call gets the URI. Later calls get an
  empty string and 0x80802015, and a URI of 1024 bytes or more comes
  back cut to 1024 bytes with no terminator.

(cherry picked from commit f31e78833252faf8ab929967f2f0f05ee68fb48f)
---
 vita3k/app/src/app.cpp                        |  1 +
 vita3k/app/src/app_init.cpp                   |  1 +
 vita3k/config/include/config/state.h          |  1 +
 vita3k/config/src/config.cpp                  |  3 +++
 vita3k/emuenv/include/emuenv/state.h          | 19 +++++++++++++++++++
 vita3k/interface.cpp                          |  3 +++
